#compdef maint-install
# Completion for Core's `maint-install` (zsh/55-maint.zsh): the daily run time as HH:MM
# (24-hour). Offer a few sensible default times as hints while still accepting any HH:MM.
# The colon in "HH:MM" is escaped — `_arguments` splits a spec on bare colons, so the
# unescaped form parsed "MM, 24h)" as the action and threw a parse error on every <tab>.
_arguments '1:run time (HH\:MM, 24h):(02:00 09:00 13:00 18:00 22:00)'
